#: BAM/BAM_BamAutomat_M.py:2623
msgid "Defines how much specular reflections are tinted by Base Color.\n\n• 0.0 = pure white reflections (no tint)\n• 1.0 = fully tinted reflections by Base Color\n• 0.5 = balanced, physically-correct default for non-metals\n\nIn Blender 3.x, Specular Tint is numeric. In Blender 4+, it is a color value for more artistic control."
msgstr "定义镜面反射受基础色着色的程度。\n\n• 0.0 = 纯白反射（无着色）\n• 1.0 = 完全由基础色着色\n• 0.5 = 平衡的非金属物理正确默认值\n\n在 Blender 3.x 中，镜面色调是数值。在 Blender 4+ 中，它是颜色值，可提供更多艺术控制。"

